@startuml Spm_ComCdd_tx
participant Spm
participant RTE
participant LdCom
participant PduR
participant SecOC
participant SoAd
participant TcpIp

Spm -> Spm : message Ready
activate Spm

note left
Transmission path
end note

Spm -> RTE: **Rte_Write_SumSpm_PP_Spm_Msg_SPM_dt(...)**
activate RTE

RTE -> LdCom : **LdCom_Transmit()**
activate LdCom

LdCom -> PduR: **PduR_LdComTransmit()**
activate PduR

PduR -> Spm: **SpmLo_Transmit()**
activate Spm
activate PduR

Spm -> Spm: Add metadata to PDU

Spm -> PduR: **PduR_SpmUpTransmit()**
activate Spm
activate PduR

PduR -> SecOC: **SecOC_Transmit()**
activate SecOC
activate PduR

SecOC -> PduR: **PduR_SecOCTransmit()**
activate PduR
activate SecOC

PduR -> SoAd: **SoAd_IfTransmit()**
activate SoAd

SoAd -> TcpIp: **TcpIp_UdpTrasmit()**
activate TcpIp

TcpIp --> SoAd 
deactivate TcpIp

SoAd --> PduR
deactivate SoAd

PduR --> SecOC
deactivate SecOC
deactivate PduR

SecOC --> PduR
deactivate SecOC
deactivate PduR

PduR --> Spm
deactivate PduR
deactivate Spm

Spm --> PduR
deactivate Spm
deactivate PduR

PduR --> LdCom
deactivate PduR

LdCom --> RTE
deactivate LdCom

RTE --> Spm
deactivate RTE
deactivate Spm

@enduml